## The lit floor: a clear glass plate over a 9 by 7 grid of upward polygon emitters in a white tray.
## Each tile's radiance falls from the centre to 40% at the corners, like a real panel's.
## The panel needs gman with polygon area lights (main at 86ef3c1 or later).
